      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rising_Sun%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits on the disputed Nottingham Lots, once claimed by William Penn and settled by Quakers in 1702.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rising_Sun%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1760s, Charles Mason and Jeremiah Dixon surveyed the area and confirmed Rising Sun lay within Maryland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
