      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rising_Sun%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Six years after the Philadelphia and Baltimore Central Railroad, the Baltimore Central Railroad began serving Rising Sun, spurring growth.",
